\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Earth, rejoice, our Lord is King
\par Sons of men, His praises sing;
\par Sing ye in triumphant strains,
\par Jesus the Messiah reigns.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Power is all to Jesus given,
\par Lord of hell, and earth and heaven;
\par Every knee to Him shall bow;
\par Satan, hear, and tremble now.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Angels and archangels join,
\par All triumphantly combine,
\par All in Jesu's praise agree,
\par Carrying on His victory.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Though the sons of night blaspheme,
\par More there are with us than them;
\par God with us, we cannot fear;
\par Fear ye friends, for Christ is here.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Lo to faith's enlighten sight,
\par All the mountain flames with light;
\par Hell is nigh, but God is nigher,
\par Circling us with hosts of fire.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Christ the saviour is come down,
\par Points us to the victor's crown,
\par Bids us take our seats above,
\par More than conquerors in His love.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

